# The web image's build context is the repo root (see Dockerfile): only the app and the files it shares with the old
# pages go in, never secrets, local data or what the build makes itself.
*
!frontend/
!app/static/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/**/*.log
frontend/**/*.module.css.d.ts
# A developer's local settings: a VITE_* value in them would be built into the app.
frontend/.env*
